      "status": "complete",
      "alt": "",
      "context_before": "",
      "context_after": "支撑体系的坍塌，是本轮韩股下跌中最值得关注的结构性变化之一。",
      "path": "assets/figure_003.png",
      "sha256": "9848614efd4f9ff9651eaa2cb38c6f26bcad396c86b9325f5cfe5d1f48780255",
